    },
    "Direct uitvoeren" : {
      "comment" : "Toggle: send a newline after the snippet",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run immediately"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit apparaat" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the local side of the file browser",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit apparaat heeft geen toegangscode. Zonder toegangscode kan sssh niets vergrendelen." : {
      "comment" : "Explains that the lock needs a device passcode",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device has no passcode. Without one, sssh has nothing to lock with."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit apparaat heeft geen toegangscode. Zonder toegangscode kan sssH niets vergrendelen." : {
      "comment" : "Explains that the lock needs a device passcode",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "This device has no passcode. Without one, sssH has nothing to lock with."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit kan betekenen dat de server opnieuw is geïnstalleerd. Het kan ook betekenen dat iemand het verkeer onderschept. Verbind alleen als u weet welke van de twee het is." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the two reasons a host key changes and advises caution",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This can mean the server was reinstalled. It can also mean someone is intercepting the traffic. Only connect if you know which it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt: op een server is er geen prullenbak." : {
      "comment" : "Warning that remote deletion is permanent",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This cannot be undone: a server has no trash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dit sleuteltype wordt nog niet ondersteund." : {
      "comment" : "A private key file type is not supported",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This key type is not supported yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download" : {
      "comment" : "Button that downloads the selected remote files",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drie soorten" : {
      "comment" : "Help section title: tunnel kinds",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Three kinds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamisch (-D)" : {
      "comment" : "Tunnel kind: dynamic SOCKS proxy",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dynamic (-D)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ed25519" : {
      "comment" : "Key type: Ed25519",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ed25519"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ed25519 is korter, sneller en op elke server sinds 2014 bruikbaar. Kies dit tenzij je weet dat je RSA nodig hebt." : {
      "comment" : "Explains why Ed25519 is the default",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ed25519 is shorter, faster, and works on every server since 2014. Choose this unless you know you need RSA."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een fragment is een bewaarde opdracht. Open de bibliotheek met ⇧⌘S in een sessie, of via het menu in de zijbalk om te beheren. Klik op een fragment om het naar de terminal te sturen." : {
      "comment" : "Help: what snippets are and how to open the library",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A snippet is a saved command. Open the library with ⇧⌘S in a session, or from the menu in the sidebar to manage them. Click a snippet to send it to the terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een host toevoegen" : {
      "comment" : "Help section title: adding a host",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Adding a host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een hostsleutel die je goedkeurt wordt onthouden en gesynchroniseerd, zodat een véranderde sleutel — het signaal dat ertoe doet — op elk apparaat opvalt." : {
      "comment" : "Help: known host keys",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A host key you approve is remembered and synced, so a changed key — the signal that matters — stands out on every device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een naam mag geen schuine streep bevatten en kan niet . of .. zijn." : {
      "comment" : "Explains why a proposed filename is not allowed",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A name cannot contain a slash, and cannot be . or .."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een profiel bepaalt lettertype, kleuren en cursor. Je kunt er een per host of per groep instellen." : {
      "comment" : "Empty state body for the terminal profile list",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A profile sets the font, colours and cursor. You can assign one per host or per group."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een SOCKS5-proxy op dit apparaat. De server maakt de verbindingen, dus het verkeer lijkt daarvandaan te komen." : {
      "comment" : "Explains what a dynamic forward does",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A SOCKS5 proxy on this device. The server makes the connections, so the traffic appears to come from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een SSH-client voor Mac, iPad en iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Tagline in the about window",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "An SSH client for Mac, iPad, and iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een tunnel loopt over deze verbinding en stopt als die wegvalt. Tunnels die automatisch starten komen bij elke herverbinding terug." : {
      "comment" : "Footer explaining that tunnels live and die with the connection",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A tunnel runs over this connection and stops when it drops. Tunnels that start automatically come back on every reconnection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Een tunnel stuurt een poort door over de SSH-verbinding. sssH kent dezelfde drie als ssh: -L brengt een poort van de server naar dit apparaat, -R andersom, en -D maakt een SOCKS5-proxy die al je verkeer via de server stuurt." : {
      "comment" : "Help: the three tunnel kinds",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A tunnel forwards a port over the SSH connection. sssH knows the same three as ssh: -L brings a port from the server to this device, -R the other way around, and -D makes a SOCKS5 proxy that sends all your traffic through the server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
