    },
    "Heb je al een ~/.ssh/config? Importeer die via het menu rechtsboven in de zijbalk, dan staan je hosts er in één keer in." : {
      "comment" : "Help: importing an ssh config",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Already have a ~/.ssh/config? Import it from the menu at the top right of the sidebar, and your hosts are all there in one go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Herstel na opnieuw starten" : {
      "comment" : "Help section title: session restore",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Restore after relaunch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hervatten" : {
      "comment" : "Collision option: continue an interrupted transfer",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hervatten werkt alleen als het bestaande bestand korter is dan het origineel. Is het langer, dan is het een ander bestand en wordt er opnieuw begonnen." : {
      "comment" : "Explains when resuming applies",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resuming only applies when the existing file is shorter than the original. If it is longer it is a different file, and the transfer starts over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Het bewaren in de sleutelhanger is mislukt: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Shown when writing a secret to the Keychain failed",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saving to the keychain failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Het werk draait op de server. Valt de verbinding weg, dan draait alles gewoon door en pak je het na opnieuw verbinden op waar je was. Eén sessienaam per host betekent terugkeren naar dezelfde sessie in plaats van een stapel anonieme." : {
      "comment" : "Help: tmux survives disconnects",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "The work runs on the server. If the connection drops, everything simply keeps running, and after reconnecting you pick up where you were. One session name per host means returning to the same session instead of a pile of anonymous ones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Host" : {
      "comment" : "Placeholder for a tunnel's destination host",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
