    "Hosts en instellingen synchroniseren" : {
      "comment" : "Toggle for CloudKit sync of configuration",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sync hosts and settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts toevoegen, inloggen en verbinden" : {
      "comment" : "Help topic summary: getting started",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Adding hosts, signing in, and connecting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts, groepen, fragmenten, tunnels en hostsleutel-vingerafdrukken gaan via je eigen iCloud. Wachtwoorden en sleutels niet — die staan in de sleutelhanger. Een wijziging werkt bij de volgende start." : {
      "comment" : "Explains exactly what configuration sync covers and that it needs a restart",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hosts, groups, snippets, tunnels and host key fingerprints go through your own iCloud. Passwords and keys do not — those are in the keychain. A change takes effect at the next launch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hostsleutels" : {
      "comment" : "Help section title: host keys",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Host keys"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Iets op de server verbindt met een poort daar, en komt uit op dit apparaat." : {
