    "Invulvelden" : {
      "comment" : "Section header listing a snippet's placeholders",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fields"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is een server alleen via een tussenstap bereikbaar, stel dan een jump host in. Een bastion is gewoon een andere opgeslagen host, en een keten van meerdere sprongen mag." : {
      "comment" : "Help: jump hosts",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "If a server can only be reached through an intermediate step, set up a jump host. A bastion is just another saved host, and a chain of multiple hops is fine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je privésleutels en wachtwoorden komen dan op je andere Apple-apparaten te staan, via de iCloud-sleutelhanger. Dat is end-to-end versleuteld, maar ze staan dan niet langer alleen hier." : {
      "comment" : "Explains what turning on secret sync does before it happens",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your private keys and passwords will then be on your other Apple devices, through iCloud Keychain. That is end-to-end encrypted, but they will no longer be only here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je sessies blijven open. Ontgrendel om ze weer te zien." : {
      "comment" : "Body on the lock screen, saying sessions are not closed",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your sessions stay open. Unlock to see them again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kan %@ niet bereiken (%@)." : {
      "comment" : "The TCP connection could not be made; second placeholder is a technical reason",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
